XNNPACK/YNNPACK, Slinky, and CPUINFO are fetched rather than vendored. Their
upstream LICENSE files remain in the corresponding dependency directories.
Patches identify their upstream files and are distributed with this project.
The XNNPACK BSD license is also retained in third_party/XNNPACK-LICENSE.

Native tokenization uses fetched mlc-ai/tokenizers-cpp (Apache-2.0), Hugging
Face tokenizers (Apache-2.0), SentencePiece (Apache-2.0), and Abseil (Apache-2.0).
Their original notices and LICENSE files remain in the bootstrapped sources
and Cargo cache. SentencePiece retains its embedded protobuf-lite notices.
Cargo dependency versions and checksums are recorded in
patches/tokenizers.Cargo.lock. The tokenizer FFI and offline-build patches
retain upstream file provenance.

